  "about": "The pack registry. One entry per data pack, carrying its version, the lane it came through, the documents behind it, when it was ingested, by what extractor, a checksum over the file, and the spread of confidence inside it. src/world/data.js loads what this file lists, so adding a pack means adding it here. docs/INGEST.md is the contract; tools/gate-audit.mjs enforces it.",
  "offline_note": "This is a committed file, not a lookup. The running twin fetches these paths off its own origin and nothing else, ever. Ingestion is an offline step that produces committed, versioned, checksummed data.",
  "confidence_scale": {
    "values": [
      "high",
      "medium",
      "low"
    ],
    "note": "The one scale. Each pack defines these three words in its own terms in its own confidence_scale block, because what counts as a high-confidence tide table is not what counts as a high-confidence species record. Nothing may add a fourth word, and a rating that is null is not a rating."
  },
  "statuses": {
    "committed": "A fact about the island as it is, from a citable source.",
    "contributed": "Supplied by a contributor through the contribution lane, attributed, and not yet verified by a second source.",
    "proposed": "Something somebody has proposed, modelled or is studying. It stays marked proposed wherever it is rendered, forever. A plan never becomes a fact by being modelled.",
    "withdrawn": "A contributor withdrew this record. The id survives with the marker so the record disappears honestly rather than silently."
  },
