      "produces": "a pack written by hand from public sources, with per-record source and confidence",
      "note": "The lane every pack in this repository came through: an agent reading public sources and writing JSON. It is not repeatable by machine and there is no extractor code behind it, which is exactly the gap the other lanes close. No new pack should use this lane."
